WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:32.630
M-Matoba...

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:36.260
My other self will awaken!

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:44.770
Another Busoma will be born.

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:49.610
The other Shiryu...
Is he another vessel of the Busoshin?

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:58.410
I can feel a similar aura
to mine within you.

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:01.910
Yes, you and I are the same.

00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:04.660
I see. So you are the inferior.

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:07.660
In the end, you are merely my shadow!

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:10.210
Gai!

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:16.210
Lady Himiko!

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:19.800
Wh-What do I do?

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:21.850
Gai!

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:32.360
Gai, no! Turn back! Don't fight!

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:44.450
Gai...

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:53.630
What?

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:56.880
Give back... Gai!

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:03.930
Fool!

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:07.060
What can a mere human do?

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:16.860
Inferior Shiryu... become one with me!

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:23.740
The vessel of the Busoshin...

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:26.740
What is a god? I do not know.

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:29.040
But I will find out.

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:34.290
Impossible...

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:37.050
How could a small wound like this...

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:39.590
Gai!

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:56.860
You shouldn't get up yet.
Your wound is not a small one.

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:01.110
Gai... Where's Gai?

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:05.530
I don't know.
I wasn't in a state to follow him.

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:13.040
Stand down, Zsoltgewinn!

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:16.250
It is not yet time.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:21.970
The two Shiryu must be of equal power
for the Busoshin to be complete.

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:27.510
Then I shall wait for that time.

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:36.310
But you were hurt before this,
weren't you?

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:39.860
To do something so reckless,
with such an injury...

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:44.360
I wasn't thinking.

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:46.910
Next thing I knew, Gai was...

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:56.250
I'm sorry, I haven't thanked you yet.
Even though you saved me...

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:01.130
Don't worry about it.
Saving people is more or less my job.

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:02.960
What's your name?

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:04.760
Ogata--

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:08.510
I'm sorry, you shouldn't be talking yet.

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:10.430
Will you rest a bit more?

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:12.850
I'm sorry.

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:19.270
Kigetsu.

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:20.820
Amon?

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:23.400
What do you see beyond the horizon?

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:26.700
An inescapable future, I'd imagine.

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:29.620
Is it done?

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:34.660
Here is the blade made
from the legendary tamahagane.

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:37.210
I have named it Mikazuki.

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:38.960
Mikazuki...

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:43.800
It shines as pure as crystalized snow.

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:46.840
The power the clan's founder used
to drive away evil

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:49.430
appears to have been revived
within this blade.

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:54.600
Kigetsu, I have a request.

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:55.730
What is it?

00:05:55.810 --> 00:06:00.150
May I please borrow
the divine blade, Mikazuki?

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:05.240
There is an evil that must be slain.

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:07.320
The Shiryu?

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:08.860
Yes.

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:18.580
That man...

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:24.920
You can see it, yes?
That man is human and yet inhuman.

00:06:33.140 --> 00:06:35.720
So this is a god?

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:37.890
To those who can see it, yes.

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:41.270
It is said that those reflected
in the mirror

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:44.610
can be used as a vessel
to connect with the god.

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:48.110
Do you creatures have a god as well?

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:52.030
The Busoshin,
who will lead humanity to destruction.

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:55.910
And when humanity
is destroyed, what then?

00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:59.410
Destruction and creation
are two sides of the same coin.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:03.790
If men can create gods,
so can weapons.

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:08.630
So the same as humans,
monsters worship unseen gods.

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:13.470
Same as humans?
I was born of my own will.

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:16.180
I am different from you lesser beings.

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:17.890
Then we are the same.

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:22.400
Both men and Busoma seem to believe
that they are born by themselves.

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:26.900
That body is a human's,

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:30.320
and it was also a human
who forged the weapon, yes?

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:35.700
I have elevated this inferior human
to a higher being!

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:39.960
My name is Zsoltgewinn!
I have no need for gods!

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:48.130
What is... that sword?

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:51.720
If you are the avatar of a weapon,
then you should feel it.

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:56.810
The divine blade Mikazuki,
an innocent and newly forged sword.

00:07:57.310 --> 00:08:01.640
A completely pure weapon,
comprised of only human emotions.

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:04.520
Human emotions?

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:08.570
Weapons must have
their own desires to kill,

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:11.240
and that's what gives them
their true power!

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:28.880
I am the destroyer...

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:32.130
So this is the power of the Mikazuki?

00:08:58.990 --> 00:09:00.700
Unbelievable!

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:04.330
A god?

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:17.720
Do not be sad.
You broke the blade of his heart.

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:22.430
The Mikazuki will someday become a chain,
binding humanity and the Busoma.

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:33.490
You just got up and you're already eating?

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:35.570
You must have been really hungry.

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:38.950
S-Sorry.

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:41.740
Kazumo, what is this called?

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:44.120
It's called "cheese cake", ma'am.

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:48.500
It melts! It melts in my mouth!

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:50.380
Kazumo, this was a nice selection.

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:51.750
Thank you.

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:57.380
Though I am glad
to see your wounds have healed.

00:09:58.260 --> 00:09:59.220
You're right.

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:01.260
But how?

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:03.010
That's a secret.

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:06.140
More importantly,
what's your relationship with Gai?

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:08.690
You don't seem to have just met.

00:10:09.650 --> 00:10:11.650
Yes, we were always together.

00:10:11.730 --> 00:10:13.400
We're not related, but...

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:16.400
We're basically family.

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:17.360
I see.

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:20.070
I've heard the story of Gai's birth.

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:23.620
Um, how do you know Gai?

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:26.160
What kind of acquaintance
are you with him?

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:31.330
We were fated to meet, I suppose.
Though it's like an ill-omened fate.

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:33.040
Ill-omened?

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:37.300
I'm sorry, but who are you, exactly?

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:41.050
I am Himiko of the Gabi.

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:44.350
Twenty-four weapons rest within my body.

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:47.640
Twenty-four weapons?

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:49.560
I don't understand.

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:52.020
You don't? That's fine.

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:55.360
It's a world you can't understand.

00:10:56.230 --> 00:11:00.360
There's no need to know about it.
Instead, tell me more about yourself.

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:06.490
<i>Commander Matoba!</i>

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:08.910
What's going on?

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:12.040
<i>Well, it's your son, Shin!</i>

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:13.750
Show me.

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:28.310
So you've come, after all.

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:31.640
You seek battle, don't you Shin?

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:34.560
You've become a Busoma, haven't you?

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:47.450
Shin, I shall grant your wish.

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:57.090
Activate all Chrysali.

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:28.120
Shin, I am so proud of you.

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:31.040
Do you understand my feelings?

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:45.260
That day, when you lost your mother...

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:49.310
N-No... Stay away!

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:51.720
No!

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:58.940
That day, I feared and hated the Busoma.

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:03.490
So to learn more about them,
I made contact with the Shoshidai.

00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:08.830
But eventually, I realized something.

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:14.080
The more I learned about them,
the more I couldn't deny my feelings.

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:18.290
That's right. I've come
to worship the Busoma.

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:21.750
Such a powerful aura!

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:27.180
Such pure violence!

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:33.390
I wanted to give you
the best love possible.

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:37.060
I wanted you to become Busoma.

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:41.980
You and Rie had the ability to do so.

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:45.490
The hatred that formed
when your mother was killed.

00:13:46.610 --> 00:13:48.820
I went through the effort
to get the Shiryu

00:13:48.910 --> 00:13:52.580
in hopes that it would
someday become your Core Alma.

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:55.660
No, perhaps the Shiryu chose you.

00:13:58.170 --> 00:14:01.670
I failed to artificially turn Rie
into a Busoma, but...

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:05.590
She was useful.

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:09.840
She provided you
with even greater despair,

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:12.640
and shattered your hopes as a human.

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:15.810
And you are now complete.

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:18.520
Now that you've become a Busoma,

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:21.860
you let go of your weak human heart!

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:33.490
My dear angel!

00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:54.390
Shin, now there's nothing left
to bring you sadness.

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:57.020
Even my death!

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:08.650
Karaoke?

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:11.660
Normal girls do karaoke for fun?

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:12.570
Yes.

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:17.290
Or eat sweets, or just talk...

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:18.620
Wait.

00:15:19.210 --> 00:15:20.920
What, exactly, is karaoke?

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:22.710
Y-You don't know?

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:25.750
No, I've heard rumors...

00:15:25.840 --> 00:15:28.920
But I grew up in a temple.
We don't even have a TV.

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:30.470
You sing.

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:34.510
You hold a mic and sing along with music.

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:36.680
That's karaoke?

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:38.140
I see, I see.

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:41.230
But what's fun about singing?

00:15:41.310 --> 00:15:43.230
Well, it just kind of is.

00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:45.980
I don't understand.

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:49.400
What about Gai?
Does he do karaoke too?

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:51.490
No, Gai doesn't at all.

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:54.490
Oh, he did once!

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:56.740
I forced him to go.

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:59.120
Wh-What? You forced him?

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:04.250
You look calm,
but you're a beast, aren't you?

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:06.000
It's not like that.

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:09.880
So did he sing at karaoke?

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:12.800
No, not at all.

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:17.510
He just listened to me sing,
and eventually fell asleep.

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:18.970
Fell asleep?

00:16:22.350 --> 00:16:23.640
I see, I see.

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:26.610
That's Gai for you. That's right.

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:29.360
That's who Gai should be.

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:39.870
What do I do? She's not getting up.

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:43.960
Is she dead? Is she alive?

00:16:52.260 --> 00:16:53.300
Gai!

00:16:56.510 --> 00:16:58.760
Don't worry, I won't do anything.

00:16:58.850 --> 00:16:59.680
Gai?

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:05.020
Did you... turn back?
Back to the old Gai?

00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:06.650
I don't know.

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:10.570
Friends... Are we friends, Gai?

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:15.700
No, I have no friends. Ask someone else.

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:21.240
Kuromaru.

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:23.660
I'm sorry for everything.

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:26.870
Gai!

00:17:33.260 --> 00:17:34.090
You're awake?

00:17:34.470 --> 00:17:36.340
Are you okay? How's your wound?

00:17:37.130 --> 00:17:38.050
Are you okay?

00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:41.260
Who... who are you?

00:17:42.930 --> 00:17:45.180
Who are you?

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:51.570
But Gai can be nice sometimes, too.

00:17:52.690 --> 00:17:53.610
How so?

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:56.780
He made this for me.

00:17:57.860 --> 00:17:59.660
To protect me, he said.

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:04.120
Sayaka, I thought of you when I made it.

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:07.670
Gai...

00:18:11.540 --> 00:18:16.340
A lot has happened since we were kids,
but I was happy that Gai was there for me.

00:18:18.590 --> 00:18:20.680
He made me cry many times, but...

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:26.100
I was the only one who knew
that he was actually a nice person.

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:31.520
But I think Gai doesn't know
what to do with himself.

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:34.230
I believe in him!

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:38.150
I believe the old Gai
will come back someday!

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:41.490
Are you in love with him?

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:54.250
Exhausted from talking, huh?

00:18:54.840 --> 00:18:57.010
Her wounds have only just healed, too.

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:15.570
Did you call me, Zsoltgewinn?

00:19:16.730 --> 00:19:18.940
What is the god you speak of?

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:22.070
What happens after mankind is destroyed?

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:25.120
Have you gone mad?

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:30.290
When the Busoshin is born,
there'll be no need for human vessels.

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:33.290
We can make a world for only Busoma.

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:36.960
A pure world,
where we can devour each other

00:19:37.050 --> 00:19:38.840
and only the strongest will remain.

00:19:39.170 --> 00:19:42.050
Men created us from their desire.

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:45.760
It is only with their emotions
that we become weapons.

00:19:45.850 --> 00:19:48.520
There are some things
even weapons cannot be.

00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:54.360
I have seen the strength
of human emotions.

00:19:56.070 --> 00:19:57.530
Nonsense.

00:20:13.710 --> 00:20:14.540
Gai!

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:32.980
So humanity's poison
has dulled your blade?

00:20:33.310 --> 00:20:37.060
If nothing else, you can feed my strength,
Zsoltgewinn.
